    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d314">

                <pb facs="0294" n="284" xml:id="pg284"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Executive Secretariat Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Note by the Executive Secretary of the National Security
                        Council</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Souers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Council </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-02-11">February 11, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">NSC 37/3</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">The Strategic Importance of Formosa</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Pursuant to NSC Action No. 179–<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>,<anchor n="61"
                        xml:id="d314-f1"/> the Secretary of Defense has forwarded the enclosed
                    memorandum from the Joint Chiefs of Staff, containing their views on the
                    subject, supplementary to those contained in NSC 37.<anchor n="62"
                        xml:id="d314-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>The enclosure is accordingly circulated herewith for the information of the
                    National Security Council and for use by the NSC Staff in preparing a
                    supplementary report on Formosa pursuant to NSC Action No. 179–<hi
                        rendition="#italic">d</hi>.<anchor n="63" xml:id="d314-f3"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sidney</hi> W. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Souers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d314-a1.xml" xpointer="d314-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d314-f1" n="61" xml:id="d314-f1-content">
                <p>Agreement by NSC on February 3, 1949, that the Joint Chiefs of Staff furnish the
                    National Security Council an estimate of the extent of the threat to the
                    security of the United States in the event that diplomatic and economic steps to
                    deny Communist domination of Formosa prove insufficient, and recommendations as
                    to what, if any, military measures be taken in that event.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d314-f2" n="62" xml:id="d314-f2-content">
                <p>December 1, 1948, <ref target="#pg261">p. 261</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d314-f3" n="63" xml:id="d314-f3-content">
                <p>Directive to the NSC Staff to prepare a supplementary report on Formosa.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
